# S012622 candidate summary

Added `src/include/crypto/ecdh.rs` as the path-preserving Rust translation of
`include/crypto/ecdh.h`.  The candidate contains immutable provenance, the
four curve identifiers, `#[repr(C)] struct ecdh`, and C ABI declarations for
`crypto_ecdh_key_len`, `crypto_ecdh_encode_key`, and
`crypto_ecdh_decode_key`.  Pointer ownership and decode-buffer aliasing are
documented at the ABI boundary.
